  "text": "SKIP TO CONTENT\nConsidered bags. Everyday companions.\nShop the collection\n→\nSHOP\nNEW ARRIVALS\nOUR PHILOSOPHY\nCONTACT\nATELIER VEYNE\n0\n\nATELIER VEYNE\n\nQuietly essential.\n\nConsidered shapes for the things you carry.\n\nEXPLORE THE COLLECTION\nExplore by shape\nShoulder bags\nCrossbody bags\nTote bags\nMini and clutch bags\nWallets and cardholders\nAccessories\n\nTHE EVERYDAY EDIT\n\nBest Sellers\n\nFind your everyday companion. Explore the shapes at the heart of Atelier Veyne.\n\nVIEW ALL\nNEW\nCove shoulder bag\n$99.00\nCOLOR\nBone\nBlack\nTaupe\nR\nread\nADD TO BAG\n— COVE SHOULDER BAG\nArc shoulder bag\n$119.00\nCOLOR\nBlack\nCognac\nBone\nADD TO BAG\n— ARC SHOULDER BAG\nNEW\nPath crossbody bag\n$89.00\nCOLOR\nTaupe\nBlack\nOlive\nADD TO BAG\n— PATH CROSSBODY BAG\nNEW\nPlane tote bag\n$119.00\nCOLOR\nBone\nTaupe\nBlack\nADD TO BAG\n— PLANE TOTE BAG\nNew arrivals\nVIEW ALL\nNEW\nCove shoulder bag\n$99.00\nCOLOR\nBone\nBlack\nTaupe\nR\nread\nADD TO BAG\n— COVE SHOULDER BAG\nNEW\nSALE\nDrift shoulder bag\n$89.00 $109.00\nCOLOR\nOlive\nBlack\nADD TO BAG\n— DRIFT SHOULDER BAG\nNEW\nPath crossbody bag\n$89.00\nCOLOR\nTaupe\nBlack\nOlive\nADD TO BAG\n— PATH CROSSBODY BAG\nNEW\nPlane tote bag\n$119.00\nCOLOR\nBone\nTaupe\nBlack\nADD TO BAG\n— PLANE TOTE BAG\nNEW\nSALE\nDusk clutch\n$69.00 $89.00\nCOLOR\nBlack\nCognac\nADD TO BAG\n— DUSK CLUTCH\nNEW\nSlip cardholder\n$39.00\nCOLOR\nBone\nBlack\nCognac\nADD TO BAG\n— SLIP CARDHOLDER\n\nOUR PHILOSOPHY\n\nFewer, better things.\n\nWe believe the pieces you reach for every day should feel effortless. Simple shapes, calm colors and considered proportions are the starting point for everything we design.\n\nFrom a compact shoulder bag to a roomy tote, each silhouette has a place in the rhythm of a day. Our philosophy is to keep the essentials in focus and let the details speak quietly.\n\nAtelier Veyne Studio\n\nDESIGN AND PROPORTION\n\nIn good company\n1\n2\n\n1 PLANE TOTE BAG\n\n2 TURN WALLET\n\nA considered edit\nVIEW ALL\nNEW\nCove shoulder bag\n$99.00\nCOLOR\nBone\nBlack\nTaupe\nR\nread\nADD TO BAG\n— COVE SHOULDER BAG\nArc shoulder bag\n$119.00\nCOLOR\nBlack\nCognac\nBone\nADD TO BAG\n— ARC SHOULDER BAG\nNEW\nPath crossbody bag\n$89.00\nCOLOR\nTaupe\nBlack\nOlive\nADD TO BAG\n— PATH CROSSBODY BAG\nNEW\nPlane tote bag\n$119.00\nCOLOR\nBone\nTaupe\nBlack\nADD TO BAG\n— PLANE TOTE BAG\nLine tote bag\nRegular price\n$129.00\nBlack — Line tote bag\nTaupe — Line tote bag\nCHOOSE OPTIONS\n— LINE TOTE BAG\nPetal mini bag\n$79.00\nCOLOR\nBone\nOlive\nADD TO BAG\n— PETAL MINI BAG\n\nHONEST CONSTRUCTION\n\nA Direct Comparison\n\nA closer look at the details that matter.\n\nA Direct Comparison\nFeature and craft\tAtelier Veyne\tWhat to look for\nMaterials\tFind the stated composition on each product page.\tCheck the material and finish for the piece you choose.\nHardware\tCheck the closure and hardware details for each design.\tLook for clear information about hardware and fastening.\nEdges and seams\tExplore the close-up product photographs.\tCompare finishing details using actual product photography.\nInterior\tSee each product's dimensions and interior details.\tCompare capacity and pocket placement with your essentials.\nCare\tFollow the care information supplied for your product.\tCheck the care instructions for the actual material.\n\nINQUIRIES\n\nFrequently Asked Questions\n\nStraightforward answers regarding sizing, leather care, and shipping.\n\nWILL MY PHONE FIT INSIDE THE BAG?\nIS THE LEATHER WATER RESISTANT?\nHOW LONG DOES SHIPPING TAKE?\nWHAT IS YOUR RETURN POLICY?\nCAN THE SHOULDER STRAP LENGTH BE ADJUSTED?\nATELIER VEYNE\n\nConsidered bags and everyday essentials. Calm colors, thoughtful proportions.\n\nSHOP\nShoulder bags\nCrossbody bags\nTote bags\nMini and clutch bags\nWallets and cardholders\nAccessories\nCLIENT CARE\nFAQ\nContact\nShipping and returns\nOur philosophy\nSTUDIO NOTES\n\nNew shapes, collection updates and occasional notes from the atelier.\n\nEmail address\nJOIN\n\n© 2026 Atelier Veyne\n\nPrivacy policy\nYour Bag\n(0)\n\nYour bag is empty\n\nExplore bags and everyday essentials.\n\nCONTINUE SHOPPING\nOffers\n\nATELIER VEYNE\n\nGood things,\ncarried together.\n\nYOU'RE INVITED\n\nWelcome to Atelier Veyne.\n\nA little something for your everyday. Join our list for private offers, new arrivals and notes from the atelier.\n\nYOUR EMAIL ADDRESS\nJOIN THE ATELIER\n\nBy joining, you agree to receive emails from Atelier Veyne. Unsubscribe anytime. Privacy policy.\n\nFIND YOUR PAIR · SAVE 10% ON YOUR BAG →\nI'll keep exploring",
